      "\"A list of what?\"",
      "\"People who've been in contact with FreeLight Collective.\" Riko put the folder on the bench. It was thin. It was thinner than Amara expected. \"Chen Wei's people have been posting your spec to relay nodes all week. Somebody on your floor is feeding them.\"",
      "\"Then find the somebody. Don't move four people who haven't done anything.\"",
      "\"Two of the four have done something.\" Riko's face did not change. \"One of them is Yuki Sato.\"",
      "Amara did not look at Yuki. This was, she would think later, the first real decision she made in that facility — and she made it in a quarter of a second, by not looking, and she has never been sure whether it was loyalty or cowardice.",
      "\"No,\" Amara said.",
      "\"It's not a request.\"",
      "\"You need her. You have six months and a chalk drawing and no one else on this site has read my Methods section closely enough to catch it when I'm wrong.\" Amara closed the folder. \"If you take her off this floor, you take four months with her. Tell Garrett that. Tell him I said it in those words.\"",
