      "\"No, you'll get it in a minute and it'll cost you a minute more.\" He does not sit down. \"Either the light is a thing that came back on its own, in which case there's nothing to do but wait and everything we know is wrong. Or the light is a thing that was *kept*, by people, on purpose, for ten years, in a room we walked past the door of. And I don't know which is worse, because one of them means we were never alone up there, and the other one means we were never alone down here.\"",
