      "\"It was.\" Garrett turns to Riko. \"I'm reorganising the chain of command. Effective immediately, all personnel on this site report to Exodus corporate security, not to you. You're relieved.\"",
      "Riko does not move. She has spent eleven years learning how to not move when someone points a gun at her, and this is not a gun but it is close enough.",
      "\"Relieved of what, sir?\" she says.",
      "\"Of everything. Pack your kit. There's a truck leaving in an hour.\"",
      "Amara steps forward. \"Garrett. What is this?\"",
      "\"This is a leak, Amara.\" Garrett's smile disappears. \"Somebody on this site fed the Helios Array specification to FreeLight Collective. Fourteen pages, including orbital mechanics, mirror tolerances, and coverage estimates. Do you know what Isaiah Cross did with that? He put it on eleven frequencies. Eleven. I have senators asking me if I'm building a weapon that turns off the sun.\"",
      "\"It's not a weapon,\" Amara says.",
