      "Riko speaks. Her voice is flat and calm, the voice she uses when she is calculating angles. \"Sir. With respect. If you remove me now, you lose eleven years of institutional knowledge about this site's vulnerabilities. You don't know where the blind spots are. You don't know who's related to who, who's in debt to who, who's been approached by who.\"",
      "\"Then tell me,\" Garrett says.",
      "\"I can't tell you what I don't know yet. I've been working on it.\"",
